      "content": "i know, i know people say that. but it doesn't change the math of it. it feels like i'm living on borrowed time, and the interest is just making everyone around me miserable because they have to deal with my guilt and my sadness. if i could just balance the scales, wouldn't that be more peaceful? for everyone? i just want the heaviness to stop for everyone.",
